# Post-run improvement clearance

When the task mentions **post-run review**, **Persistent weaknesses**, **improvement plan**,
**intensive clearance**, or clearing Analysis tab backlog themes:

1. Read [`docs/ops/post-run-improvement-clearance.md`](../../docs/ops/post-run-improvement-clearance.md) first.
2. Follow [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) § Post-run persistent weaknesses & intensive clearance.
3. Do **not** treat suggestion rollup counts as open engineering tasks.
4. Route themes through ingest factory (Lane A), engineering queue batching (Lane B),
   and `email_only` narrative refresh (Lane C) — never a parallel clearance queue.

Named state files only: `docs/data/latest.json`, `docs/data/engineering_tasks.json`,
`docs/data/system_gaps.json`, `docs/data/library/last_ladder.json`.
